      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<div style=\"padding: 16px; background: rgba(30, 34, 42, 0.6); border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); font-family: sans-serif;\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    <div>\n      <h3 style=\"margin: 0; color: #4FC3F7;\">\ud83d\udd0d Jaeger Distributed Tracing Portal</h3>\n      <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; color: #B0BEC5; font-size: 14px;\">Inspect microservice dependency calls, span latencies, and end-to-end execution waterfalls.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <a href=\"http://localhost:16686\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background: #1976D2; color: #FFF; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(25, 118, 210, 0.4);\">\ud83d\ude80 Open Jaeger Web UI</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <hr style=\"border: none; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); margin: 12px 0;\" />\n  <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; color: #ECEFF1; font-size: 13px;\">\n    <div style=\"flex: 1;\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #81C784;\">1. Direct Trace Lookup</strong>\n      <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0;\">Click any log line in <em>Section 4 (Logs)</em> below that contains a <code>traceid</code>. Click the blue <strong>Jaeger Trace</strong> badge to open its waterfall timeline.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"flex: 1;\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #FFB74D;\">2. Search Traces by Microservice</strong>\n      <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0;\">Open Jaeger UI to search by service (<code>api-gateway</code>, <code>transaction-service</code>, <code>auth-service</code>) or operation duration.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"flex: 1;\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #BA68C8;\">3. Active Trace Target</strong>\n      <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0;\">Current Trace ID variable: <code style=\"background: #263238; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; color: #4FC3F7;\">$trace_id</code></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      }
